Package: glib-networking
Version: @DEB_GLIB_NETWORKING_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib-networking
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgnutls30, ca-certificates
Description: TLS support for GLib networking on Xios
 glib-networking provides the GIO TLS backend used by libsoup and WebKitGTK.
 This build uses GnuTLS and the environment proxy resolver, giving GTK apps
 HTTPS without depending on a separate desktop proxy service.
